n recording showing the user creating a GitHub Copilot coding session from an issue and watching it edit files, run tests, and open a pull request.",type:"video"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w2,dark:w2},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:w2,dark:w2}},alt:"Screen recording showing the user creating a GitHub Copilot coding session from an issue and watching it edit files, run tests, and open a pull request.",type:"video"}}},{label:"Centralized inbox",description:"Triage issues and PRs across repos, without leaving the app.",visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wK,dark:wK},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wJ,dark:wJ}},alt:"Screen recording showing the user navigating GitHub Copilot from Home to My work, switching repositories, and posting a review comment on a failing pull request.",type:"video"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wX,dark:wX},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wX,dark:wX}},alt:"Screen recording showing the user navigating GitHub Copilot from Home to My work, switching repositories, and posting a review comment on a failing pull request.",type:"video"}}},{label:"Shape canvases",description:"Open a live work surface where you and the agent edit, reorder, and verify the same artifact together.",visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w6,dark:w6},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:w5,dark:w5}},alt:"Screen recording showing the user and Copilot editing and reorganizing content on a shared shape canvas.",type:"video"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w7,dark:w7},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:w7,dark:w7}},alt:"Screen recording showing shape canvas interactions in the GitHub Copilot app on mobile.",type:"video"}}},{label:"Review and merge",description:"Review diffs, check CI, and fix failing checks. Merge when you\u2019re ready from the same window the agent works in.",visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w4,dark:w4},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:w3,dark:w3}},alt:"Screen recording showing the user reviewing a GitHub Copilot pull request's diff and merging it once checks pass.",type:"video"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w0,dark:w0},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:w0,dark:w0}},alt:"Screen recording showing the user reviewing a GitHub Copilot pull request's diff and merging it once checks pass.",type:"video"}}}],a11y:{tabSelector:"Explore main features",play:"Play video",pause:"Pause video"}},features:{heading:"Run multiple sessions across every area of work",body:"Open a session from real work across your issues, pull requests, or prompts.",items:[{heading:"Parallel workflows, fully in view",body:"Take control of your workflow. Every session comes with a workspace for your branches, files, and conversations.",cta:{label:"Learn more",href:"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/github-copilot-app/agent-sessions"},visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wY,dark:wY},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wF,dark:wF}},alt:"App sidebar with Home, My work, Automations, and Search, plus a Sessions list; a dark-mode icon session is selected.",type:"image",position:"bottom-right"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wY,dark:wY},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wF,dark:wF}},alt:"App sidebar with Home, My work, Automations, and Search, plus a Sessions list; a dark-mode icon session is selected.",type:"image",position:"bottom-right"}}},{heading:"Isolated spaces for every session",body:"Work stays separated, even when you have more than one task in motion.",cta:{label:"Learn more",href:"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/github-copilot-app/agent-sessions#starting-a-session"},visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w$,dark:w$},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wD,dark:wD}},alt:"Dropdown 'Where to run this session' with New worktree (selected) and Local repository options.",type:"image"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:w$,dark:w$},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wD,dark:wD}},alt:"Dropdown 'Where to run this session' with New worktree (selected) and Local repository options.",type:"image"}}},{heading:"Built-in validation loop",body:"Inspect diffs, preview via in-app browser, run terminal checks, and merge PRs directly inside your session.",cta:{label:"Learn more",href:"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/github-copilot-app/managing-issues-and-pull-requests"},visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wU,dark:wU},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wG,dark:wG}},alt:"Code diff showing 6 files changed; a single-line TypeScript type export is rewritten as a multi-line export block.",type:"image"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wU,dark:wU},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wG,dark:wG}},alt:"Code diff showing 6 files changed; a single-line TypeScript type export is rewritten as a multi-line export block.",type:"image"}}},{heading:"Automated workflows",body:"Turn skills and prompts into repeatable work that can be run on a regular basis.",cta:{label:"Learn more",href:"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/github-copilot-app/using-scheduled-workflows"},visual:{desktop:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wW,dark:wW},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wq,dark:wq}},alt:"New workflow dialog: name 'Morning triage', Daily interval, auto-run enabled, issue-triage prompt, Create button.",type:"image"},mobile:{src:{[ch.OS.macOS]:{light:wW,dark:wW},[ch.OS.Windows]:{light:wq,dark:wq}},alt:"New workflow dialog: name 'Morning triage', Daily interval, auto-run enabled, issue-triage prompt, Create button.",type:"image"}}}]},highlight:{a11y:{heading:"Design craft built-in"},video:{src:"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CRSV0euIn7M",title:"How to use the new Impeccable skill in the GitHub Copilot app",poster:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/CRSV0euIn7M/maxresdefault.webp"},heading:{lead:"Design craft built-in.",body:"The GitHub Copilot app ships with Impeccable, the open-source design skill, raising the bar for the agent\u2019s output."},cta:{actions:w8,menuLabel:w9},items:["**23 design commands.** Use `/critique` for a design review, `/typeset` to fix the typography, `/layout` to adjust spacing, and `/polish` for a final pass.","**Teach it your system once.** Give design system context up front, and the agent remembers y